      "name": "price_unit",
      "options": [
        "--price-unit"
      ],
      "raw_name": "PriceUnit",
      "required": false,
      "type": "string"
    },
    {
      "example": "5",
      "help_en": "The unified expiration date. If you specify this parameter, the price for renewing the instance to the unified expiration date is queried. Valid values: 1 to 28.\n\nFor more information about the unified expiration date feature, see https://help.aliyun.com/document_detail/108486.html.\n\nThe renewal duration parameters (`Period` and `PeriodUnit`) and the unified expiration date parameter (`ExpectedRenewDay`) cannot be set at the same time",
